# Signing material. Every one of these is a private key that can publish as us,
# and each arrives as a loose file next to the thing that needed it: a keystore
# generated by keytool, a certificate exported from Keychain Access, a profile
# downloaded from the developer portal, an App Store Connect .p8. They belong in
# a password manager and in GitHub secrets, never in a commit.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
keystore.properties
